  <h1 id="GameFramework_Services_GameDataService" data-uid="GameFramework.Services.GameDataService" class="text-break">Class GameDataService
  </h1>
  <div class="markdown level0 summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.GameDataService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="5">Clean GameDataService that manages unified GameSession data
Single source of truth for all game state information
Delegates all save/load operations to SaveService
Uses TimeService for all playtime tracking - no manual time management</p>
</div>
  <div class="markdown level0 conceptual"></div>
